  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Enchantment Spell. For 2...5...6 seconds, all party members in earshot have a 75% chance to block incoming attacks. If an attack is blocked, all allies in earshot are healed for 10...34...40 and Shield Guardian ends.",
      "zhTW": "持續 2～6 秒，使目標盟友有 75% 機率「格擋」敵人的攻擊，而當目標盟友成功「格擋」攻擊時，該目標及其附近的所有盟友獲得 10～40 體力，同時守護者之盾的效果終止。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Enchantment Spell. For 1...3...4 seconds, all party members in earshot have a 75% chance to block incoming attacks. If an attack is blocked, all allies in earshot are healed for 10...30...35 and Shield Guardian ends.",
